<item><title>Liberia and Guyana sign air services deal, opening route to South America</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-and-guyana-sign-air-services-deal-opening-route-to-d8579d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-and-guyana-sign-air-services-deal-opening-route-to-d8579d/</guid><category>Liberia</category><description>The agreement creates a legal framework for passenger and cargo flights between the two countries, but no start date for services has been set.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:14:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" length="31000" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
